{"title":"Gravewrap Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 48) · Monster drop: Kragg The Unmoved, Moonfane Moth, Rimewing, Selene, Mother Of Moths, Ogre Mauler +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 48 <span class=\"muted\">(2602 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/burial-wrappings\">Burial Wrappings</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimewing\" title=\"Rimewing - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8c3a3c351144b327cb83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimewing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moon-mother\" title=\"Selene, Mother Of Moths - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7c86cf4529db3a6a02f0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Selene, Mother Of Moths</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 1 of 112 looted corpses (1/112)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/112<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"moonfane-moth\" title=\"Moonfane Moth - dropped it in 1 of 303 looted corpses (1/303)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ac436496b9298e59bc40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonfane Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/303<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 669 looted corpses (1/669)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/669<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 1,882 looted corpses (1/1,882)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,882<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gravewrap-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/burial-wrappings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\">Burial Wrappings</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/12067670c90381512ea9.svg\" alt=\"Gravewrap Arms\"></div><h3>Gravewrap Arms</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tailoring 48</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/30/2026